els are okay, but too much isn't. Both seem relevant, but I think C is a stronger support because it directly links less synthesis to better health, which aligns with the idea that too much is harmful.\n\nSo, the best answer should be C.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: C\n\nThe reasoning is that option C directly supports the idea that excessive neuronectin synthesis leads to autism by showing that inhibiting it relieves symptoms, which aligns with the hypothesis that too much synthesis is problematic.\n\nThe correct option is: C",
