re the main channels. This directly supports the expert's view because if these channels are the main ones, physical branches might become obsolete. The expert is saying that traditional branches will disappear, and if online is the main service, that makes sense.\n\nSo, comparing B and D. Option B talks about changing impressions, which might lead people to prefer online, but D directly states that online is the main service, which would weaken the need for branches. Therefore, D is a stronger supporter of the expert's prediction.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: D\n\nThe reasoning is that option D directly supports the expert's view by stating that online and mobile banking are the main channels of service, which would weaken the necessity of traditional bank branches. \n\nThe correct option is: D",
